-- reminders before an approved visit
('visit_reminder_48h', 'guest', 50, '48 hours before', 'See you in 2 days',
 'Looking forward to seeing you! Your [type] with the Burns-Konkles is in 2 days, on [date] at [time]. Need to change or cancel? [link]'),
('visit_reminder_24h', 'guest', 51, '24 hours before', 'Reminder: tomorrow at [time]',
 'Reminder: your [type] with the Burns-Konkles is tomorrow at [time]. Anyone who''s sick, even with a cold, should stay home. Change or cancel: [link]'),
('visit_reminder_12h', 'guest', 52, '12 hours before (rules reminder)', 'Your visit is coming up at [time]',
 'Your visit with the Burns-Konkles is coming up at [time]. A quick refresher: shoes off at the door, wash hands when you arrive, no visit if anyone is sick (cold, fever, vomiting, rash, or persistent cough within 72 hours), no smoking or vaping within 72 hours, no outside alcohol, and please don''t arrive more than 10 minutes early without approval. Full rules: [rules link]. Is everyone healthy? Tap to confirm: [healthy link]. Someone sick? Tap to cancel: [cancel link]'),
('visit_reminder_2h', 'guest', 53, '2 hours before (photos and privacy)', 'Your visit is in 2 hours',
 'Reminder: your visit with the Burns-Konkles is in 2 hours. A note on photos: please take none without permission and post nothing to social media, ever. Micala and Gabriel decide who sees their home and family, and no pictures of the baby or Vincent may be posted. Ask consent before taking any picture in the home. Thank you for respecting this boundary!'),
('visit_reminder_15m', 'guest', 54, '15 minutes before (rules reminder)', 'See you in 15 minutes!',
 'See you in 15 minutes! Quick reminders: shoes off, wash your hands when you come in, no photos without asking, and please don''t come in if anyone feels sick. Thank you!'),

-- Meal Train
('meal_signup', 'guest', 60, 'Meal Train sign-up', 'Thank you for signing up to bring a meal',
 'Thank you for signing up to bring a meal, [first name]! Your slot: [slot], [date], [time window]. Please confirm what you''ll bring here: [link]. Family meal needs: [dietary needs]. Please wait to be confirmed and approved before asking for the address or stopping by the house. Thank you!'),
('meal_approved', 'guest', 61, 'Meal Train approved', 'You''re confirmed to bring [dish]',
 'Thank you so much! You''re confirmed to bring [dish] on [date], [time window]. Please drop food in the cooler out front, then knock or ring the bell to alert the family. No need to wait for an answer. This is not an invitation inside or to stay; please book a separate visit if you''d like to see the family, and respect that they are focusing on resting and bonding.'),
('meal_denied', 'guest', 62, 'Meal Train denied', 'About your Meal Train slot',
